            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.71</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>3D Scene Composer (beta).</b> Build a set, place the camera and animate the scene in 3D. 3D Paul, a dedicated director agent, plans camera moves with measured framing, cuts and lens choices, renders a reference video and writes the video prompt for you.</li>
<li><b>Reference video with depth pass.</b> Attach the rendered scene, optionally with a depth map, as a video reference for generation.</li>
<li><b>Scene objects.</b> Rename and delete objects in the scene, and watch new 3D generations appear as placeholders while they render.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
